{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054730/extras/8c3dfaf9661405bd921abc1f6e5fe06f.poster.avif?t=1760366597\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054730/extras/8c3dfaf9661405bd921abc1f6e5fe06f.webm?t=1760366597\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054730/extras/8c3dfaf9661405bd921abc1f6e5fe06f.mp4?t=1760366597\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Depth of Mind\u00a0</strong></u>is a  turn-based <strong>roguelite </strong>with<strong>\u00a0</strong>psychological horror elements where you lead team of mental operatives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By improving their allies, endowing them with new abilities, and collecting artifacts, the player must defeat all mental illnesses inside the human mind so that he no longer suffers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this risky journey, teamwork and hope are important for every member of the team.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect unique mental operatives, each with its own abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The psychedelic atmosphere of horror</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade team with chips and artifacts</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Can you handle the agony of a man?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this demo you will find:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 starting teams</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >30 unique chips</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 story cutscenes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and much more</p></li></